FIEL-FR-2 - Protect the entire tick with finalization
Category: MustChange/rewrite. Severity: Blocker. Checklist: sections 5/7. Standing finding: GEN-7.
Locations: OperacionServicio.cs:56 (../../SPEI_SPID/SPID_FIEL/Aplicacion/OperacionServicio.cs#L56), required-key validation:127 (../../SPEI_SPID/SPID_FIEL/Aplicacion/OperacionServicio.cs#L127), late try:178 (../../SPEI_SPID/SPID_FIEL/Aplicacion/OperacionServicio.cs#L178), finalization:229 (../../SPEI_SPID/SPID_FIEL/Aplicacion/OperacionServicio.cs#L229).
Current ordering, abbreviated:
Code block (csharp)
await _IparametrosOperaciones.MarcarServicioEnEjecucion(_configuracion.NombreServicio);
var dicParametrosSistema = await _IparametrosOperaciones.parametrosSistema();
// Schedule parsing, required-key checks, and an alert occur here.
