FIEL-FR-3 - Do not convert SQL failures into empty work or successful updates
Category: MustChange/rewrite. Severity: Blocker. Checklist: sections 5/8. Standing finding: GEN-11.
Locations: pending query:55 (../../SPEI_SPID/SPID_FIEL/Infraestructura/Repositorio/OperacionesRepositorio.cs#L55), parameter query:50 (../../SPEI_SPID/SPID_FIEL/Infraestructura/Repositorio/ConsultaCamposBDTomi.cs#L50), update:271 (../../SPEI_SPID/SPID_FIEL/Infraestructura/Repositorio/OperacionesRepositorio.cs#L271), success return:318 (../../SPEI_SPID/SPID_FIEL/Infraestructura/Repositorio/OperacionesRepositorio.cs#L318), partial-failure continuation:169 (../../SPEI_SPID/SPID_FIEL/Infraestructura/Repositorio/OperacionesRepositorio.cs#L169).
